# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# The Census Data API key is OPTIONAL. The pipeline runs end to end without it, using the
# keyless bulk Summary File and TIGER downloads. Setting it swaps in the API for the ACS tables
# and the 2020 block housing counts, which cuts the raw download from ~1.5 GB to ~135 MB.
#
# It is a speed-up, never a correctness dependency: tests/test_census_api.py asserts the API and
# bulk paths return identical numbers, and the run fails if they ever diverge.
#
# Request one free at https://api.census.gov/data/key_signup.html
CENSUS_API_KEY=
